<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Byoushinwo Kamu"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Byoushinwo Kamu - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO01804003"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1428083880"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>nulut &amp; ACAne</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">伪装着生活 一如往常地擦身而过</text><text for="L2">那句说出口的「我明白了」再也收不回</text><text for="L3">你是明知故犯吧？晚餐时哭过之后</text><text for="L4">你却笑了</text><text for="L5">「我也一样」 把虚假的心意一并堆叠</text><text for="L6">吐露过后又沉默 郁结愈积愈深</text><text for="L7">多想亲口对你说一声「再见」</text><text for="L8">可我连道别的资格都没有</text><text for="L9">潜入灰烬之中 咬住秒针</text><text for="L10">在白日梦里将它狠狠击碎</text><text for="L11">可它不肯碎裂 也不肯停下</text><text for="L12">就这样不知「真相」地走下去</text><text for="L13">只想就这样夺走 藏起 遗忘</text><text for="L14">哪怕我们之间没有一处相通</text><text for="L15">相见时也别回我一句「对不起」</text><text for="L16">因为我不要虚无的言语</text><text for="L17">挥之不去的后遗症 「无论什么我都会接纳」</text><text for="L18">只留下这句话 便再也不会回来</text><text for="L19">哪怕那是胡言 哪怕并非为了我</text><text for="L20">我也曾被你守护</text><text for="L21">仿佛双眼与嘴唇都失去了意义</text><text for="L22">我将自己封闭 再也动弹不得</text><text for="L23">请别找到我 让我独自待着好吗</text><text for="L24">无论看向哪里 身处何方 都无法敞开</text><text for="L25">潜入肺腑之中 咬住秒针</text><text for="L26">在白日梦里将它一遍遍击碎</text><text for="L27">可它依旧不碎 也不肯停下</text><text for="L28">如果还要继续扮演下去</text><text for="L29">只想就这样夺走 藏起 遗忘</text><text for="L30">即使我们之间没有一处相通</text><text for="L31">相见时也请别回我「对不起」</text><text for="L32">因为我已不需要空洞的言语</text><text for="L33">苦苦追寻 放声呼喊 却等不来天明</text><text for="L34">强颜欢笑 摔得狼狈不堪</text><text for="L35">明明谁都没有错</text><text for="L36">却想将过错归咎于谁</text><text for="L37">「我真的存在吗？」</text><text for="L38">其实我心里明白</text><text for="L39">即使被抛下 我也还是会相信</text><text for="L40">就这样夺走 藏起 只想忘却</text><text for="L41">就这样夺走 藏起 只愿忘却</text><text for="L42">就这样夺走 藏起 却想向你倾诉</text><text for="L43">哪怕我们之间没有一处相通</text><text for="L44">相见时也别回我一句「对不起」</text><text for="L45">「只会怀疑的我 为何还值得你如此对待？」</text><text for="L46">我不要那些无法抚平伤痛的谎言</text><text for="L47">夜空放晴</text></translation></translations><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:30.849" end="0:31.624">sei katsu no </span><span begin="0:31.624" end="0:33.015">gizou </span><span begin="0:33.229" end="0:33.705">i tsu mo </span><span begin="0:33.705" end="0:33.995">toori </span><span begin="0:33.995" end="0:34.453">toori</span><span begin="0:34.453" end="0:34.995">su gi te</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:35.025" end="0:35.513">ikkai </span><span begin="0:35.513" end="0:35.861">itta </span><span begin="0:35.861" end="0:36.340">「wa kat ta。」 </span><span begin="0:36.340" end="0:36.667">modo ra</span><span begin="0:36.667" end="0:37.362">nai</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:38.253" end="0:39.020">kaku shin han </span><span begin="0:39.020" end="0:40.435">desho？ </span><span begin="0:40.647" end="0:41.353">yuu shoku chuu ni </span><span begin="0:41.353" end="0:41.970">naita </span><span begin="0:41.970" end="0:42.433">ato</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="0:42.446" end="0:43.170">kimi wa </span><span begin="0:43.170" end="0:44.035">warat te </span><span begin="0:44.035" end="0:44.538">ta</span></text><text for="L5"><span begin="0:45.609" end="0:47.474">「watashi mo sou da yo。」 </span><span begin="0:47.474" end="0:47.893">tte </span><span begin="0:47.994" end="0:48.533">itsuwa ri no </span><span begin="0:48.533" end="0:48.852">ki mo chi </span><span begin="0:48.852" end="0:49.604">gas san shite</span></text><text for="L6"><span begin="0:49.819" end="0:50.183">haite </span><span begin="0:50.183" end="0:50.713">damat te </span><span begin="0:50.713" end="0:51.110">zut to </span><span begin="0:51.110" end="0:52.653">ta mat te</span><span begin="0:52.653" end="0:52.848">ku</span></text><text for="L7"><span begin="0:53.032" end="0:53.411">nani ga </span><span begin="0:53.411" end="0:54.987">nan demo </span><span begin="0:55.246" end="0:56.153">men to mu kat te </span><span begin="0:56.153" end="0:57.170">「sa yo na ra」</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="0:57.226" end="0:57.627">suru </span><span begin="0:57.627" end="0:58.504">shi kaku mo </span><span begin="0:58.504" end="0:59.193">nai </span><span begin="0:59.261" end="0:59.936">mama </span><span begin="0:59.936" end="1:00.740">boku wa</span></text><text for="L9"><span begin="1:00.923" end="1:01.604">hai ni </span><span begin="1:01.604" end="1:02.328">mogu ri </span><span begin="1:02.511" end="1:03.603">byou shin o </span><span begin="1:03.603" end="1:04.117">kami</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="1:04.323" end="1:05.729">haku chuu mu no </span><span begin="1:05.729" end="1:06.412">naka de </span><span begin="1:06.412" end="1:07.230">gan gan </span><span begin="1:07.230" end="1:08.206">kuda i ta</span></text><text for="L11"><span begin="1:08.279" end="1:08.715">demo </span><span begin="1:08.715" end="1:09.872">kowa re nai </span><span begin="1:09.939" end="1:11.575">to mat te ku re nai</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="1:11.729" end="1:12.636">「hon tou o </span><span begin="1:12.636" end="1:13.543">shi ra nai </span><span begin="1:13.543" end="1:14.213">mama </span><span begin="1:14.364" end="1:14.980">susu</span><span begin="1:14.980" end="1:15.482">mu no </span><span begin="1:15.482" end="1:16.214">sa</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="1:16.349" end="1:17.296">ko no mama </span><span begin="1:17.296" end="1:18.175">ubat te </span><span begin="1:18.175" end="1:19.119">kaku shi te </span><span begin="1:19.119" end="1:20.687">wasu re tai</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="1:20.965" end="1:22.096">wa ka ri a u </span><span begin="1:22.096" end="1:22.534">maru </span><span begin="1:22.534" end="1:23.707">hi to tsu mo </span><span begin="1:23.707" end="1:24.754">na ku te mo</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="1:24.834" end="1:25.575">atte </span><span begin="1:25.575" end="1:26.237">「go men。」 </span><span begin="1:26.237" end="1:26.506">tte </span><span begin="1:26.506" end="1:27.635">kaesa</span><span begin="1:27.635" end="1:28.682">nai de ne</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="1:28.794" end="1:30.182">katachi no nai </span><span begin="1:30.182" end="1:31.091">koto ba wa </span><span begin="1:31.091" end="1:32.471">i ra nai </span><span begin="1:32.471" end="1:32.780">ka</span><span begin="1:32.780" end="1:34.675">ra</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="1:46.564" end="1:47.042">ki e nai </span><span begin="1:47.042" end="1:48.580">kou i shou </span><span begin="1:48.871" end="1:49.284">「nan de mo </span><span begin="1:49.284" end="1:49.681">uke</span><span begin="1:49.681" end="1:50.417">to me ru。」 </span><span begin="1:50.417" end="1:50.714">to</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="1:50.725" end="1:51.182">itta </span><span begin="1:51.182" end="1:51.414">kiri </span><span begin="1:51.414" end="1:51.672">mou </span><span begin="1:51.672" end="1:52.240">kaeru koto </span><span begin="1:52.240" end="1:52.972">wa nai</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="1:53.969" end="1:54.566">de ta ra me </span><span begin="1:54.566" end="1:55.894">demo </span><span begin="1:56.171" end="1:57.055">boku no tame ja </span><span begin="1:57.055" end="1:58.033">na ku te mo</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="1:58.042" end="1:58.795">kimi ni </span><span begin="1:58.795" end="2:00.100">mamo ra re ta</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="2:02.025" end="2:02.555">me mo </span><span begin="2:02.555" end="2:03.358">kuchi mo </span><span begin="2:03.934" end="2:04.980">imi ga nai </span><span begin="2:04.980" end="2:05.614">hodo ni</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="2:05.633" end="2:06.306">fusa gi</span><span begin="2:06.306" end="2:06.983">konde </span><span begin="2:07.109" end="2:08.231">ugo ke nai </span><span begin="2:08.231" end="2:09.221">boku o</span></text><text for="L23"><span begin="2:09.425" end="2:10.396">mi tsu ke nai </span><span begin="2:10.396" end="2:10.928">de </span><span begin="2:11.296" end="2:11.850">hot toi te </span><span begin="2:11.850" end="2:12.890">ku re nai ka</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="2:12.898" end="2:13.834">doko mi te mo </span><span begin="2:13.834" end="2:14.728">doko ni itemo </span><span begin="2:14.728" end="2:15.126">a</span><span begin="2:15.233" end="2:15.636">ka</span><span begin="2:15.695" end="2:16.129">na</span><span begin="2:16.129" end="2:16.453">i</span></text><text for="L25"><span begin="2:16.608" end="2:17.307">hai ni </span><span begin="2:17.307" end="2:17.939">mogu ri </span><span begin="2:18.161" end="2:19.290">byou shin o </span><span begin="2:19.290" end="2:19.777">kami</span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="2:19.985" end="2:21.442">haku chuu mu no </span><span begin="2:21.442" end="2:22.093">naka de </span><span begin="2:22.093" end="2:23.008">gan gan </span><span begin="2:23.008" end="2:23.923">kuda i ta</span></text><text for="L27"><span begin="2:23.962" end="2:24.446">demo </span><span begin="2:24.446" end="2:25.557">kowa re nai </span><span begin="2:25.611" end="2:27.232">to mat te ku re nai</span></text><text for="L28"><span begin="2:27.400" end="2:28.058">enji</span><span begin="2:28.058" end="2:28.972">tsuzu ke ru </span><span begin="2:28.972" end="2:29.267">no </span><span begin="2:29.267" end="2:30.134">nara</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="2:30.143" end="2:31.100">ko no mama </span><span begin="2:31.100" end="2:32.089">ubat te </span><span begin="2:32.089" end="2:32.961">kaku shi te </span><span begin="2:32.961" end="2:33.642">wasu</span><span begin="2:33.642" end="2:34.083">re</span><span begin="2:34.083" end="2:34.566">tai</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="2:34.801" end="2:35.985">wa ka ri a u </span><span begin="2:35.985" end="2:36.411">maru </span><span begin="2:36.411" end="2:37.306">hi to tsu </span><span begin="2:37.306" end="2:38.677">mo na ku te mo</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="2:38.747" end="2:39.471">atte </span><span begin="2:39.471" end="2:40.085">「go men。」 </span><span begin="2:40.085" end="2:40.332">tte </span><span begin="2:40.332" end="2:41.001">kae</span><span begin="2:41.001" end="2:41.493">sa</span><span begin="2:41.493" end="2:42.593">nai de ne</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="2:42.631" end="2:43.561">katachi no </span><span begin="2:43.561" end="2:44.006">nai </span><span begin="2:44.006" end="2:44.952">koto ba wa </span><span begin="2:44.952" end="2:46.325">i ra nai </span><span begin="2:46.325" end="2:46.569">ka</span><span begin="2:46.569" end="2:48.072">ra</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="2:53.551" end="2:53.958">sugat te </span><span begin="2:53.958" end="2:54.407">saken de </span><span begin="2:54.407" end="2:55.038">asa wa </span><span begin="2:55.038" end="2:55.306">nai</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="2:55.306" end="2:55.815">warat te </span><span begin="2:55.815" end="2:56.235">koron de </span><span begin="2:56.235" end="2:56.984">nasa ke nai</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="2:57.232" end="2:57.683">dare no </span><span begin="2:57.683" end="2:58.342">sei demo </span><span begin="2:58.342" end="2:58.876">nai koto</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="2:59.081" end="2:59.647">dare ka no </span><span begin="2:59.647" end="2:59.973">sei ni </span><span begin="2:59.973" end="3:00.655">shi ta ku te</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="3:01.141" end="3:01.789">「boku tte </span><span begin="3:01.789" end="3:02.635">iru no ka na？」</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="3:02.930" end="3:03.568">hon tou wa </span><span begin="3:03.568" end="3:04.414">wa kat te ru n da</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="3:04.782" end="3:06.361">mi ha na sa re te mo </span><span begin="3:06.361" end="3:07.341">shin ji te </span><span begin="3:07.341" end="3:08.017">shi ma u </span><span begin="3:08.017" end="3:08.902">yo</span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="3:25.567" end="3:26.548">ko no ma ma </span><span begin="3:26.548" end="3:27.482">ubat te </span><span begin="3:27.482" end="3:28.367">kaku shi te </span><span begin="3:28.367" end="3:29.068">wasu</span><span begin="3:29.068" end="3:29.533">re</span><span begin="3:29.533" end="3:30.261">tai</span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="3:33.005" end="3:33.842">ko no mama </span><span begin="3:33.842" end="3:34.785">ubat te </span><span begin="3:34.785" end="3:35.710">kaku shi te </span><span begin="3:35.710" end="3:36.476">wasu</span><span begin="3:36.476" end="3:36.885">re</span><span begin="3:36.885" end="3:37.786">tai</span></text><text for="L42"><span begin="3:40.316" end="3:41.226">ko no mama </span><span begin="3:41.226" end="3:42.119">ubat te </span><span begin="3:42.119" end="3:43.070">kaku shi te </span><span begin="3:43.070" end="3:43.751">hana</span><span begin="3:43.751" end="3:44.213">shi</span><span begin="3:44.213" end="3:44.744">tai</span></text><text for="L43"><span begin="3:44.942" end="3:46.080">wa ka ri a u </span><span begin="3:46.080" end="3:46.635">maru </span><span begin="3:46.635" end="3:47.492">hi to tsu </span><span begin="3:47.492" end="3:47.702">mo </span><span begin="3:47.702" end="3:48.224">na</span><span begin="3:48.224" end="3:48.852">ku te mo</span></text><text for="L44"><span begin="3:48.904" end="3:49.565">atte </span><span begin="3:49.565" end="3:50.187">「go men。」 </span><span begin="3:50.187" end="3:50.469">tte </span><span begin="3:50.469" end="3:51.159">kae</span><span begin="3:51.159" end="3:51.683">sa</span><span begin="3:51.683" end="3:52.126">nai</span><span begin="3:52.126" end="3:52.613">de ne</span></text><text for="L45"><span begin="3:52.795" end="3:53.720">「utaga u </span><span begin="3:53.720" end="3:54.554">dake no </span><span begin="3:54.690" end="3:55.304">boku o </span><span begin="3:55.304" end="3:56.278">dou shi te？」</span></text><text for="L46"><span begin="3:56.497" end="3:57.147">sukui</span><span begin="3:57.147" end="3:58.114">ki re nai </span><span begin="3:58.114" end="3:58.852">uso wa </span><span begin="3:58.852" end="4:00.162">i ra nai </span><span begin="4:00.162" end="4:00.486">ka</span><span begin="4:00.486" end="4:02.847">ra</span></text><text for="L47"><span begin="4:03.101" end="4:03.692">ha</span><span begin="4:03.692" end="4:04.396">re</span><span begin="4:04.396" end="4:06.504">ta </span><span begin="4:06.682" end="4:07.406">rei</span><span begin="4:07.406" end="4:11.176">ra</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:11.176"><div begin="0:30.849" end="4:11.176"><p begin="0:30.849" end="0:34.995" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.849" end="0:31.624">生活の</span><span begin="0:31.624" end="0:33.015">偽造</span> <span begin="0:33.229" end="0:33.705">いつも</span><span begin="0:33.705" end="0:33.995">通り</span> <span begin="0:33.995" end="0:34.453">通り</span><span begin="0:34.453" end="0:34.995">過ぎて</span></p><p begin="0:35.025" end="0:37.362" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.025" end="0:35.513">1回</span><span begin="0:35.513" end="0:35.861">言った</span><span begin="0:35.861" end="0:36.340">「わかった。」</span><span begin="0:36.340" end="0:36.667">戻ら</span><span begin="0:36.667" end="0:37.362">ない</span></p><p begin="0:38.253" end="0:42.433" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.253" end="0:39.020">確信犯</span><span begin="0:39.020" end="0:40.435">でしょ？</span> <span begin="0:40.647" end="0:41.353">夕食中に</span><span begin="0:41.353" end="0:41.970">泣いた</span><span begin="0:41.970" end="0:42.433">後</span></p><p begin="0:42.446" end="0:44.538" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.446" end="0:43.170">君は</span><span begin="0:43.170" end="0:44.035">笑って</span><span begin="0:44.035" end="0:44.538">た</span></p><p begin="0:45.609" end="0:49.604" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.609" end="0:47.474">「私もそうだよ。」</span><span begin="0:47.474" end="0:47.893">って</span> <span begin="0:47.994" end="0:48.533">偽りの</span><span begin="0:48.533" end="0:48.852">気持ち</span><span begin="0:48.852" end="0:49.604">合算して</span></p><p begin="0:49.819" end="0:52.848" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.819" end="0:50.183">吐いて</span> <span begin="0:50.183" end="0:50.713">黙って</span> <span begin="0:50.713" end="0:51.110">ずっと</span><span begin="0:51.110" end="0:52.653">溜まって</span><span begin="0:52.653" end="0:52.848">く</span></p><p begin="0:53.032" end="0:57.170" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.032" end="0:53.411">何が</span><span begin="0:53.411" end="0:54.987">何でも</span> <span begin="0:55.246" end="0:56.153">面と向かって</span><span begin="0:56.153" end="0:57.170">「さよなら」</span></p><p begin="0:57.226" end="1:00.740" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.226" end="0:57.627">する</span><span begin="0:57.627" end="0:58.504">資格も</span><span begin="0:58.504" end="0:59.193">ない</span><span begin="0:59.261" end="0:59.936">まま</span> <span begin="0:59.936" end="1:00.740">僕は</span></p><p begin="1:00.923" end="1:04.117" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.923" end="1:01.604">灰に</span><span begin="1:01.604" end="1:02.328">潜り</span> <span begin="1:02.511" end="1:03.603">秒針を</span><span begin="1:03.603" end="1:04.117">噛み</span></p><p begin="1:04.323" end="1:08.206" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.323" end="1:05.729">白昼夢の</span><span begin="1:05.729" end="1:06.412">中で</span> <span begin="1:06.412" end="1:07.230">ガンガン</span><span begin="1:07.230" end="1:08.206">砕いた</span></p><p begin="1:08.279" end="1:11.575" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.279" end="1:08.715">でも</span><span begin="1:08.715" end="1:09.872">壊れない</span> <span begin="1:09.939" end="1:11.575">止まってくれない</span></p><p begin="1:11.729" end="1:16.214" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.729" end="1:12.636">「本当」を</span><span begin="1:12.636" end="1:13.543">知らない</span><span begin="1:13.543" end="1:14.213">まま</span> <span begin="1:14.364" end="1:14.980">進</span><span begin="1:14.980" end="1:15.482">むの</span><span begin="1:15.482" end="1:16.214">さ</span></p><p begin="1:16.349" end="1:20.687" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.349" end="1:17.296">このまま</span><span begin="1:17.296" end="1:18.175">奪って</span> <span begin="1:18.175" end="1:19.119">隠して</span> <span begin="1:19.119" end="1:20.687">忘れたい</span></p><p begin="1:20.965" end="1:24.754" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.965" end="1:22.096">分かり合う</span><span begin="1:22.096" end="1:22.534">マル</span> <span begin="1:22.534" end="1:23.707">1つも</span><span begin="1:23.707" end="1:24.754">なくても</span></p><p begin="1:24.834" end="1:28.682" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.834" end="1:25.575">会って</span><span begin="1:25.575" end="1:26.237">「ごめん。」</span><span begin="1:26.237" end="1:26.506">って</span><span begin="1:26.506" end="1:27.635">返さ</span><span begin="1:27.635" end="1:28.682">ないでね</span></p><p begin="1:28.794" end="1:34.675" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.794" end="1:30.182">形のない</span><span begin="1:30.182" end="1:31.091">言葉は</span> <span begin="1:31.091" end="1:32.471">いらない</span><span begin="1:32.471" end="1:32.780">か</span><span begin="1:32.780" end="1:34.675">ら</span></p><p begin="1:46.564" end="1:50.714" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.564" end="1:47.042">消えない</sp